From: Duotek
Subject: [PATCH 0002] legacy add-on: relative import of the companion runtime

@silurus/ooxml-legacy-office 0.89.11 (dist/legacy-source-Dds5PgNt.js) imports the companion runtime by the bare
specifier "@silurus/ooxml/internal/companion". A page without an import map cannot resolve it, and the viewer CSP
(script-src without 'unsafe-inline') forbids an inline import map. Point it at the copy of the stock file
internal-companion.mjs that sits next to it in static/lib/silurus/. The patch changes one string.
Apply from static/lib/silurus/ with: patch -p1 < 0002-...patch   (paths below are a/ b/ relative)

---
--- a/legacy-source-Dds5PgNt.js
+++ b/legacy-source-Dds5PgNt.js
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-import { MODEL_SOURCE_MODULE_PROTOCOL as e, assertCompanionRuntime as t } from "@silurus/ooxml/internal/companion";
+import { MODEL_SOURCE_MODULE_PROTOCOL as e, assertCompanionRuntime as t } from "./internal-companion.mjs";
 //#region ../core/src/internal/bundled-asset-url.ts
